  "version": "341.0.0",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-04",
  "license": "CC0 1.0",
  "citation": "Condon, D. M., & Revelle, W. (2017-2024). Selected personality data from the SAPA-Project, 7 annual releases (07Feb2017-12Jan2024). Harvard Dataverse. https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/PNGUT5; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/7A9YMV; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/FUUB2Q; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/YOEEDQ; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/JOGYUD; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/BVF52I; https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/3BTT82",
